  body: "# Transitional State Pension rate\n\n## Source-backed proposal\n\nThe chapter identifies a transitional
    route for people with pre-6 April 2016 national insurance contributions and separates that route from the full
    or reduced routes for people without pre-commencement qualifying years.\n\n## Scope and exceptions\n\nDo not
    apply a universal 35-year formula to all SP records. The source has pre-commencement calculations, contracting-out
    adjustments, reduced-rate-election provisions and other exceptions. This concept contains no pension calculation.\n\
    \n## Inspected passages\n\n- [DMG 74201, PDF page 15](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69d8f255d3e08b8871b665ab/dmg-Ch-74.pdf#page=15).\n\
    - [DMG 74204, PDF page 16](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69d8f255d3e08b8871b665ab/dmg-Ch-74.pdf#page=16).\n\
    - [DMG 74211, PDF page 16](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69d8f255d3e08b8871b665ab/dmg-Ch-74.pdf#page=16).\n\
    - [DMG 74406, PDF page 48](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69d8f255d3e08b8871b665ab/dmg-Ch-74.pdf#page=48).\n\
    \n## Provenance and review\n\nIndependent experimental interpretation of DWP guidance, not an official DWP document.
    All definitions and relationships are model-assisted and unreviewed. No individual eligibility, award, legal
    conclusion or executable rule is supplied.\n\nSource observation, listing-page update, printed revision, stated
    legal date and pension event date have separate meanings. PDF page numbers are one-based file positions; extraction
    may damage reading order, footnotes and characters. No visual PDF or specialist acceptance is claimed.\n\n-
    `dmg-vol12-ch74` — PDF SHA-256 `5961a9cb7c86814a0f6fa147c0a8a551b4258c803680fac14a95cab9eca1afd6`; page-extraction
    SHA-256 `c762e93940b4342d70d5bc96a80c3e094c91852d93868f5709e04f293faef61a`.\n"
