    predicate: http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related
    rationale: The source identifies this as a State Pension route and prevents combining it with the
      full/reduced routes merely because there are post-2016 qualifying years.
    evidence:
    - page: page/dmg-vol12-ch74/0016
      quote: "74204 A person who is entitled to SP at the transitional rate and who has some post 6.4.16 qualifying\n\
        \nyears cannot also qualify for SP1 in accordance with DMG 74101 et seq or DMG 74151 et seq.\n\n\n     \
        \                                                                                  1 Pensions Act 14, s
        4(3)"
